I'll analyze the issues and provide fixes.

## Issues Analysis

| Issue | Root Cause | Location |
|-------|-----------|----------|
| ChapterBlock Create task not working | Missing `chapter-actions` slot binding in ChapterBlock | ChapterBlock.vue |
| Create task loses file code block | `sub-task` event doesn't include the code block content | CodeViewer.vue |
| Subtask dialog text not added | `onSelectionCreateSubtask` doesn't pass content properly | ChatEntry.vue |

## Fixes

```vue src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue
<script setup>
import MarkdownViewer from '../MarkdownViewer.vue'
import Code from '../Code.vue'
import ChapterBlock from './ChapterBlock.vue'
import parser from '@/utils/markdownParser'
</script>

