## Summary of Changes

| Area | Issue | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `saveChat` | Typo `svaedChat`, missing `await`, no return value | Fixed typo, added `await`, returns final stored chat |
| `saveChat` | Always called `updateMessages` even with empty messages | Guard: only call if `messages?.length` |
| `saveChatInfo` | Didn't track new vs existing chat for status reset on error | Added `isNew` check; always registers with `LOADED` on success |
| `saveChatInfo` | Returned `updatedChat` (raw API response) instead of the stored reference | Now returns `state.chats[updatedChat.id]` for consistency |
| `loadChat` | Duplicated identical try/catch blocks for two conditions | Unified into single flow; skips load if already `LOADED` |
| `updateMessages` | `Promise.all` + only used `results[0]` for state — incorrect for multiple messages | Switched to sequential loop, handles `doc_id`-less messages via `addMessage` |

